      "content": "i hear you on the sleep quality thing but honestly im just so wired i can barely function. i feel like i'm already more \"safe\" just being crazy tired all day. if i just stick to a single 5oz pour of white wine, is there really a risk of something bad happening? like, is it actually going to cause a medical emergency or are people just being extra cautious? i just want a definitive answer so i know if i can relax tonight.",
